  "limits": [
    "Source and external-runtime identity collection occurs after every reported latency and RSS checkpoint; it does not contaminate measured import or routing memory.",
    "The runtime-input digest includes all src/ and skills/ files, package.json, and bun.lock; the verifier rebuilds it from the pinned Git commit and checks the current branch.",
    "Each raw arm binds the complete on-disk src/ tree by path, file length, and bytes; the verifier reconstructs it from the pinned Git commit.",
    "The probe times the in-memory AutoDriveCoordinator.onIdle route with immediate mocked projection and prompt ports, not the full OpenCode plugin host event path.",
    "The baseline has no recovery controller; the head uses a real inactive RecoveryController with a provider spy. Provider and fetch counters do not cover all possible network APIs.",
